NAME
     abs - integer absolute value

SYNOPSIS
     abs(i)

DESCRIPTION
     _A_b_s returns the absolute value of its integer operand.

SEE ALSO
     floor(3M)

BUGS
     You get what the hardware gives on the largest negative
     integer.

